---
// About Me Section
---

<section class="about section" id="about">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <span class="section-tag">// DISCOVER MY PROFILE</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">About <span class="text-gradient">Sadeepa Lakshan</span></h2>
            <div class="section-line"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
            <!-- YAML Terminal Window -->
            <div class="terminal-card">
                <div class="terminal-header">
                    <div class="terminal-dots">
                        <span class="dot red"></span>
                        <span class="dot yellow"></span>
                        <span class="dot green"></span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="terminal-title">sadeepa-cv.yaml</span>
                </div>
                <div class="terminal-body">
<pre><code class="yaml-code"><span class="yaml-key">name</span>        : <span class="yaml-str">"Sadeepa Lakshan"</span>
<span class="yaml-key">degree</span>      : <span class="yaml-str">"BSc. (Hons) IT & Management"</span>
<span class="yaml-key">university</span>  : <span class="yaml-str">"University of Moratuwa (UoM)"</span>
<span class="yaml-key">level</span>       : <span class="yaml-str">"Level 3 Undergraduate"</span>
<span class="yaml-key">graduation</span>  : <span class="yaml-str">"Expected 2028"</span>
<span class="yaml-key">interests</span>   : 
  - <span class="yaml-val">Software Engineering & Development</span>
  - <span class="yaml-val">Full-Stack Web (React, Node, Supabase)</span>
  - <span class="yaml-val">Embedded IoT & Microcontrollers</span>
<span class="yaml-key">status</span>      : <span class="yaml-str">"Seeking Software Engineering Internship"</span>
<span class="yaml-key">languages</span>   : <span class="yaml-val-block"><span class="yaml-str">"Sinhala (Native),</span>
<span class="yaml-str">English (Technical / Working Proficiency</span>
<span class="yaml-str">(Reading, Writing Basic Speaking))"</span></span></code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bio Text & Key Highlights -->
            <div class="about-text-content">
                <h3>Motivated IT & Management Undergraduate passionate about Software Engineering.</h3>
                <p>
                    I am an Information Technology and Management undergraduate at the <strong>University of Moratuwa</strong> seeking an internship opportunity in Software Engineering or Software Development. I focus on building real-world, practical software systems and gaining hands-on industry experience.
                </p>
                <p>
                    My expertise spans full-stack web applications using <strong>React, Node.js, Express.js, Supabase, PostgreSQL, MySQL, and MongoDB</strong>, as well as hardware integration with <strong>Arduino Mega and ESP8266</strong> microcontrollers.
                </p>

                <div class="quote-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
                    <p class="quote-text">"Interested in developing practical software solutions and gaining industry experience through real-world projects."</p>
                </div>

                <div class="about-highlights">
                    <div class="highlight-item">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
                        <div>
                            <h4>Education</h4>
                            <p>University of Moratuwa (IT & Management)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="highlight-item">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i>
                        <div>
                            <h4>Leadership Role</h4>
                            <p>Level 3 IT Faculty Batch Representative</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Focus Areas Grid -->
        <div class="focus-title">
            <h3>Core Capabilities & Focus Areas</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="focus-grid">
            <div class="focus-card">
                <div class="focus-icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Software Fundamentals</h4>
                <p>Building solid programming problem-solving skills through university coursework and hands-on coding in JavaScript and C.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="focus-card">
                <div class="focus-icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Web Development</h4>
                <p>Creating responsive user interfaces, REST APIs, and full-stack web applications with React, Node.js & Express.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="focus-card">
                <div class="focus-icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Databases & SQL</h4>
                <p>Designing relational database tables, writing SQL queries, and handling CRUD operations using PostgreSQL, Supabase & MySQL.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="focus-card">
                <div class="focus-icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Microcontroller & IoT Projects</h4>
                <p>Wiring and programming hardware devices (Arduino Mega & ESP8266) with sensors, LCDs, and wireless modules for group projects.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="focus-card">
                <div class="focus-icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-people-roof"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Student & Community Leadership</h4>
                <p>Serving as IT Faculty Batch Representative and Rotaract project coordinator, organizing student initiatives at UoM.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="focus-card">
                <div class="focus-icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i>
                </div>
                <h4>Git & Team Collaboration</h4>
                <p>Using Git and GitHub for version control, managing project repositories, and collaborating seamlessly on university software projects.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
